# A Greeting Cardian (windurst 43): the offer's mustZone operand alone. A level-10 WAR at Windurst fame 125, The
# All-New C-2000 completed. Spare One's 295 option 1: Greeting 1, Wait = now + 60, the mustZone. The wait over by GM,
# no zone change: Kororo nil (the mustZone holds; his script's 277).
lists WindurstWoods/Kororo/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Spare_One/onTrigger WindurstWoods/onEventFinish/295
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=-10,-2.75,7.5 job=WAR lvl=10
fame Windurst 125
quest Windurst.TheAllNewC2000 completed
login
trigger Spare_One                             # no greeting: 295
finish option=1                               # Greeting 1, Wait = now + 60, the mustZone
charvar Quest[2][43]Wait 1800000000           # GM: the wait over (now)
trigger Kororo                                # the wait over, the mustZone: nil; 277
finish
